<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Industrial Batch Traceability</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A surgical-grade genealogy engine that provides absolute forward and backward 
            transparency across the entire manufacturing and supply chain lifecycle.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Forward & Backward Genealogy</h2>
        <p>
            Experience perfect visibility of your material flow. In the event of a quality 
            inquiry or a regulatory audit, the Traceability module allows for the 
            instantaneous recall of a product's genealogy. 'Backward Trace' identifies 
            exactly which raw material batches from which suppliers were used in a specific 
            finished product. Conversely, 'Forward Trace' identifies every customer 
            who received a product containing a specific raw material batch, 
            facilitating targeted and rapid market recalls within minutes.
        </p>
        <p>
            This high-integrity audit trail is a critical requirement for pharmaceutical, 
            chemical, and food-processing industries where public safety is paramount.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Stage Batch Linkage</h2>
        <p>
            Track transformations with structural precision. The system maintains a complete 
            history of batch splitting and consolidation—critical for complex processes like 
            Pharmanova's granulation, compression, and final packaging stages. Every 
            intermediate batch is hard-linked to its parent and child versions, ensuring 
            that the audit trail remains unbroken even through multiple physical and 
            chemical transformations.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Regulatory & Recall Preparedness</h2>
        <p>
            Automate your recall procedures through high-standard reporting. The system 
            generates comprehensive ‘Recall Dossiers’ that consolidate production logs, 
            quality test results, and customer distribution lists into an authoritative 
            document for regulatory submission (MCAZ / SAZ). By reducing the time 
            required for batch investigation from days to seconds, Pindah Manufacturing 
            protects your organization from legal liability and operational 
            disruption.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

